// src/v4/std/text.dag
//
// Scope: Unicode text — code points (`Char`) and strings (`String`).
// Anchor: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unicode
//         (Char = a Unicode scalar value / code point)
//
// Owns:
//   - Char — a Unicode scalar value: a `Cardinality`-bounded `Nat` over the
//     valid code-point range (excludes the surrogate range)
//   - String — `FreeMonoid<Char>`
//   - inhabitance: String inhabits `FreeMonoid<Char>` (std/algebra.dag) —
//     concatenation / empty fall out of the free monoid
//
// Consumes:
//   - std/node.dag: Cardinality
//   - std/nat.dag: Nat (a code point is a bounded Nat)
//   - std/algebra.dag: FreeMonoid
//
// Status: scaffold — fill per TASKS.md T-3 (scalar/numeric stack). Replaces
//   part of the deleted std/primitive.dag; see src/v4/STRUCTURE.md
//   §"scalar/numeric concept decomposition".
// Brief: see BRIEF_TEMPLATE.md; this file's I/O contract is the immutable
// contract for the worker. Splitting this file requires explicit operator
// ratification (substrate extension = stop signal).


module v4.std.text
